# Line endings are declared, because a control compares generated files
# byte for byte and a checkout setting must not be able to fail it.
#
# Every text file in this repository is stored LF in the index. Without
# this file, `core.autocrlf=true` -- the default on Windows, and what
# `windows-latest` runs with -- writes CRLF into the working tree on
# checkout, while the schema generator renders LF. `npm run check:types`
# then reports all 31 generated modules as no longer matching the schemas,
# which is true of not one of them. That failure is the first step of the
# router CI job, so typecheck, lint, the router suite and the bundles did
# not run behind it for weeks.
#
# `text=auto` still lets git detect binaries and leave them alone.
* text=auto eol=lf
